D. RECOMMENDATION DATA FLOW DIAGRAM
================================================================================

  PRODUCTION PATH (NO EXCEL):

   Supabase fund_master_enriched table
      ↓
   fetch-fund-data edge function (source=master)
      ↓
   fetchFundMasterFunds() → toMutualFunds()
      ↓
   MutualFund[] (in memory)
      ↓
   recommendFundsV2(funds, prefs)
      ├── applyRiskConstraints()
      ├── applyGoalEligibility()
      ├── applyHorizonRules()
      ├── applyExperienceFilter()
      ├── applyAmountConstraints()
      ├── scoreV3() → compositeScore
      ├── generateExplanations()
      └── constructPortfolio() → ScoredFund[]
      ↓
   UI Dashboard / Portfolio Comparison / Strategy Engine

  VERIFIED: No .xlsx file, no read-excel-file, no xlsx library,
  no workbook involved in any runtime recommendation path.

  FALLBACK PATH (still uses Excel-derived cache, PRESERVED):

   process-workbook (edge function)
      ↓ reads Data.xlsx from Supabase Storage
      ↓ parses with xlsx library
      ↓ writes to fund_cache table
   fetch-fund-data?action=cached (edge function)
      ↓ reads from fund_cache
   useFundCache → fetchCachedData()
      ↓ only used if primary fund_master_enriched path fails


