F. FILES PRESERVED (PRODUCTION PIPELINE)
================================================================================

  These files use Excel as a data ingestion mechanism for Supabase. They are
  NOT recommendation code — they are the pipeline that feeds data INTO
  fund_master_enriched.

  supabase/functions/process-workbook/index.ts
    - Downloads Data.xlsx from Supabase Storage
    - Parses with XLSX.read()
    - Transforms and writes to fund_cache table
    - Orchestrated by fetch-fund-data edge function
    - CRITICAL: This is how fund data enters the system

  supabase/functions/sync-onedrive/index.ts
    - Alternative sync path from OneDrive
    - Same parsing logic as process-workbook
    - Writes to fund_cache table

  supabase/functions/fetch-fund-data/index.ts
    - Primary API for fund data
    - source=master → fund_master_enriched (NO Excel)
    - source=workbook → fund_cache (Excel-derived, fallback)
    - action=cached/action=full → fund_cache


